    "standardized_narrative": "In 2019, Syndicate 2623 released prior year reserves of $15.9m. This net release was driven by favorable claims development in Specialty lines ($40.4m release), Cyber & executive risk ($16.1m release), and Political, accident and contingency ($12.3m release). These releases were partially offset by adverse claims development, including strengthening in Marine ($6.7m) primarily due to US trucking, and Property ($16.1m) driven by construction and engineering. Reinsurance reserves also strengthened by $30.1m due to loss creep on prior year natural catastrophe events such as Typhoon Jebi and the Woolsey Fires, and Hurricane Maria.",
